# Every tracked file here is text read by Linux containers: Prometheus and
# Alertmanager YAML, Grafana .ini/.toml, and the compose file. Pin LF so a
# checkout on Windows cannot rewrite them to CRLF, regardless of whatever
# core.autocrlf a given clone happens to have set.
#
# text=auto still auto-detects binaries, so this stays safe if any are added.

* text=auto eol=lf
